 "kicker": "NORDBAY \u00b7 NEW ORLEANS \u00b7 2 FEB 2016",
 "caption": "PART 1/2 \u2014 The night an empty tanker hit New Orleans twice. \ud83d\udea2\u26a0\ufe0f\n\n2 Feb 2016: the 817-ft Aframax tanker Nordbay, in ballast, heads down the Mississippi in high water with a strong current behind her and wind on her beam. At Nine-Mile Point she can't make the turn \u2014 and strikes a barge dock and the city's water intakes. And the night isn't over\u2026\n\nPart 2 tomorrow. Follow so you don't miss it.\n\nSource: NTSB Marine Accident Brief MAB-17/30 (public report). Animated illustration, not a reconstruction.\n\n#marineaccident #shipping #tanker #mississippiriver #neworleans #seafarer #merchantnavy #marineengineering #NTSB #maritime #shipping_news #jaimarineshorts",
