    "wind": "Wind S, 17\u201324 kn",
    "windAt": 3.5
   },
   "narration": "Empty, she floats high. Her deck stands about forty-four feet above the water, more than her draft below. With a southerly wind of up to twenty-four knots, that high hull becomes a giant sail.",
